<Base title="About Puppet: Business Software That Bends to Your Brand" description="Puppet builds focused business software, project management and online booking, on one account with your brand, your domain and AI you control." path="/about" crumbs={[['About Puppet', '/about']]}>
<Fragment slot="hero"><h1>About Puppet</h1><p>Focused tools for small teams, on one account.</p></Fragment>
<section><div class="w prose"><p>Puppet is a family of business apps that share one sign-in, one bill and one team. We start with two: Puppet Tasks for teams that ship work, and Puppet Booking for businesses that sell appointments.</p><p>We believe small teams deserve the features big companies get: their own brand and domain, real permissions, and AI they control instead of a per-seat add-on.</p><p>Questions? See the <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>.</p></div></section>
</Base>
